1
00:06:55,384 --> 00:07:01,384
Earthstorm is a tv movie, action, science fiction
film directed by Terry Cunningham.

2
00:13:50,769 --> 00:13:56,769
A massive asteroid impact on the moon begins causing storms on
earth due to the sudden changes in ocean tides.

3
00:20:46,153 --> 00:20:52,153
But when further examination is conducted it's discovered that the moon's
structure is now entirely unstable -- threatening all life on earth.

4
00:27:41,538 --> 00:27:47,538
With time running out, a team of scientists turn to one man, demolitions expert
John Redding, in effort to find a solution and secure the moon.

5
00:34:36,923 --> 00:34:42,923
John Redding, played by Stephen Baldwin.

6
00:41:32,307 --> 00:41:38,307
Dr. Lana Gale, played by Amy Price-Francis.

7
00:48:27,692 --> 00:48:33,692
Dr. Garth Bender, played by John Ralston.

8
00:55:23,076 --> 00:55:29,076
Victor Stevens, played by Dirk Benedict.

9
01:02:18,461 --> 01:02:24,461
Albert, played by Matt Gordon.

10
01:09:13,846 --> 01:09:19,846
Bryna, played by Anna Silk.

11
01:16:09,230 --> 01:16:15,230
Matt Gordon (born 1969) is a Canadian actor, best known for playing Doc in the sports sitcom
Rent-a-Goalie, and for his portrayal of Officer Oliver Shaw in the drama series Rookie Blue.

12
01:23:04,615 --> 01:23:10,615
The tone is thought_provoking and intense.
